  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to facilitate the integration of IDPs into the host communities of the Jowhar and Baidoa areas through: Integrated and coordinated planning of the IDP response; Improved security of tenure and access to land; Appropriate  settlement and shelter solutions on self-help basis; Livelihood support and labour-intensive infrastructure development.</narrative>
  </description>
